{"seq":2,"slug":"legend-and-history","title":"传说与史实","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-laozi","title":"历史上的老子","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history/the-historical-laozi","wordCount":1695,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"life-in-mystery","title":"神秘的一生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/life-and-times/legend-and-history/life-in-mystery","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 传说与史实\n\n本章考辨历史上真实的老子。由于年代久远、史料有限，老子的生平，笼罩着神秘的色彩。透过有限的史料，人们依然能够勾勒出，历史上老子的大致面貌。两篇文档，分别呈现历史上的老子，以及神秘的一生。\n"}